{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "t001",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 03 · FIRMWARE LAB — the terminal runtime",
      "x": -1000,
      "y": -1250,
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t002",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**`main.cpp`** (12 lines)\ndelegates and nothing else",
      "x": -1000,
      "y": -1090,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t003",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**`app/attendance_app.cpp`** (248)\nlifecycle · state machine · serial ops",
      "x": -520,
      "y": -1090,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "f004",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "firmware/include/attendance_state.h",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -1090,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t005",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FIRMWARE LAB\n**BUILD PASS** — `production` compiles: RAM 13.3%, Flash 66.0%\n**0 physical components have ever been exercised by this firmware.**\n[[03 - Firmware Lab/Firmware Lab.md]]",
      "x": -1000,
      "y": -880,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "g006",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "HARDWARE SERVICES  —  `src/hardware/device_services.cpp`",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -1250,
      "width": 1900,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "#c2410c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**DisplayService — REMOVED**\nOLED/SSD1306 removed from this project\nremoved; status is serial-console only",
      "x": 30,
      "y": -1170,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t008",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**RtcService**\nDS3231 0x68\nrefuses an invalid clock",
      "x": 470,
      "y": -1170,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t009",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**IndicatorService**\nGPIO 18/19/23\ngreen+beep / red+beep",
      "x": 910,
      "y": -1170,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t010",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**FingerprintService**\nUART2 · Adafruit_Fingerprint\nverifyPassword · scan · enroll",
      "x": 1350,
      "y": -1170,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t011",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "⚠ `firmware/include/fingerprint_sensor.h` is an **11-line DEPRECATED notice**, not an interface. It declares nothing and no production source includes it. Do not mistake it for a second driver.",
      "x": 30,
      "y": -1000,
      "width": 1720,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#525252"
    },
    {
      "id": "t012",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "→ R307S over UART\n**0 bytes received**",
      "x": 1350,
      "y": -1000,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "g013",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "STORAGE + NETWORK",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -680,
      "width": 1900,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t014",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**`storage/attendance_store.cpp`**\n`/attendance.jsonl` · CRC32 per line\nnever auto-formats · torn tail ≠ record",
      "x": 30,
      "y": -600,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t015",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**acknowledgement + compaction**\ntemp → backup-rename → swap\n**100 pending / 48 KiB** hard bound",
      "x": 580,
      "y": -600,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t016",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**`network/network_service.cpp`**\nWi-Fi · HTTP · `Bearer` token\nretry oldest every 10 s",
      "x": 1030,
      "y": -600,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t017",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**FastAPI**\n`POST /api/v1/attendance`\n201 RECORDED / 200 DUP",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": -600,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "g018",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "STATE MACHINE  —  never fabricates a fact",
      "x": -1000,
      "y": -640,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t019",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "`BOOT`",
      "x": -970,
      "y": -570,
      "width": 170,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t020",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "`SELF_TEST`",
      "x": -780,
      "y": -570,
      "width": 190,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t021",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "`WAITING_FOR_FINGER`",
      "x": -570,
      "y": -570,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t022",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "`IDENTIFYING`",
      "x": -570,
      "y": -470,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t023",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "`ATTENDANCE_RECORDED`",
      "x": -350,
      "y": -570,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t024",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "`SYNCING`",
      "x": -350,
      "y": -470,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t025",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "`ERROR`",
      "x": -970,
      "y": -370,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t026",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "`OFFLINE`",
      "x": -740,
      "y": -370,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t027",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "`RECOVERY`",
      "x": -510,
      "y": -370,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "#0891b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "t028",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "no valid RTC → no timestamp, so no event · no durable write → no “saved locally” · no API ack → no “attendance OK”",
      "x": -970,
      "y": -280,
      "width": 850,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "g029",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "OPERATOR SERIAL CONSOLE  —  UART0 115200",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -290,
      "width": 1900,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "#0891b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "t030",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**`HELP`**\nlist commands",
      "x": 30,
      "y": -220,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#0891b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "t031",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**`STATUS`**\nstate · sensor · rtc · storage · wifi · pending",
      "x": 490,
      "y": -220,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#0891b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "t032",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**`SETTIME Y-M-D H:M:S`**\nset DS3231 local wall time, +05:30, no NTP",
      "x": 950,
      "y": -220,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#0891b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "t033",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**`ENROLL <student-uuid>`**\ntwo-capture enrollment; needs sensor **and** an online backend assignment",
      "x": 1410,
      "y": -220,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#0891b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "t034",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Enrollment is deliberately unreachable from a scan. A checksummed NVS intent records the completion obligation and is retried on boot.",
      "x": 30,
      "y": -140,
      "width": 1820,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "g035",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "BUILD",
      "x": -1000,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 480,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
