    {
      "id": "t040",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**27 environments**\n`production` (default) · `esp32dev`\n15 component · 9 integration\n\n```\npio run -d firmware -e production\n```\n\nCosmetic debt: `[env:production]` still filters `+<fingerprint/*.cpp>`; no such directory exists. PlatformIO ignores it — the build is unaffected.",
      "x": -510,
      "y": 470,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 460,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
